    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Subscriptions Reminder\n## What is this for?\nGet automated Slack reminders for upcoming subscription renewals using data from Google Sheets. Sends reminders at 10, 5, and 2 days before due dates (can be optimized), and updates renewal dates after payment confirmations.\n\n## Why?\nThis is made for services we pay for that our outside our App/Play store.**  I don't rely on their emails as they came a little too late to prepare for.\n\n\n **Tip:**  \nYou can change the reminder intervals (10, 5, 2 days) by editing the number in each *IF* node.\n\n\n## More Info on Each Step\n\nOnce payment is confirmed:\n→ The next renewal date is recalculated  28 days from the current renewal date; even if you pay 5 days earlier.\n→ The Google Sheet is updated automatically\n\n\n\n**Calculation of Next Payment Date**\n2 days were removed for monthly payments, this means instead of 30 days from the last payment, we made it 28 days. This is just like a soft buffer. You can edit this in the code node if you want it to be exactly 30 days.",
